      "text": "user , comments\n\n\nuser :        \n\n{\n    userId:  uuid PK\n    email:   varchar\n    address:  varchar\n    creationTime:  timestamp\n    updationTime: timestamp\n    globalContextId:  varchar.\n\n    index -> userId\n  \n}",
