      "versionNonce": 953610452,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1742924438856,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Db choices: \nData access pattern\n\n1. its a write heavy system.\n2. query -> mostly write \n    a. write comments. \n3.  not very complex join , transactions. \n4.  we can use cassandra. \n5.  partition by userId -> partition key.  sort \n    key could be comment. -> horizontally scale -\n    might need to take care hotpartition.\n6. based on LSM tree and SST table -> which is\n   optimised for write rather b-tree ->  \n   optimised for read mostly.  \n",
      "fontSize": 20.10731832002377,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Db choices: \nData access pattern\n\n1. its a write heavy system.\n2. query -> mostly write \n    a. write comments. \n3.  not very complex join , transactions. \n4.  we can use cassandra. \n5.  partition by userId -> partition key.  sort \n    key could be comment. -> horizontally scale -\n    might need to take care hotpartition.\n6. based on LSM tree and SST table -> which is \n   optimised for write rather b-tree ->  \n   optimised for read mostly.  \n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
